{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33020","headline":"旅次岳阳寄京中亲故 · 曹邺","name":"旅次岳阳寄京中亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君山南面浪连天，一客愁心两处悬。\n身逐片帆归楚泽，魂随流水向秦川。\n月回浦北千寻雪，树出湖东几点烟。\n更欲登楼向西望，北风催上洞庭船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}